 thank you!\\nTake good care of it, please!\\r","msg_0576_T24R0201_00002":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\\na Pokémon!","msg_0576_T24R0201_00003":"Your Pokémon party is full.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00004":"Oh, no... What’ll I do if he comes back?","msg_0576_T24R0201_00005":"Hi! How’s my Pokémon?\\rI think I’m safe now, so may I have\\nit back? {YESNO 0}","msg_0576_T24R0201_00006":"Hi! How’s my Pokémon?","msg_0576_T24R0201_00007":"Thank you!","msg_0576_T24R0201_00008":"Hey, that’s not my Pokémon.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00009":"My Pokémon has come to like you.\\rAll right, you should keep it.\\nBut promise to be good to it!","msg_0576_T24R0201_00010":"Oh, no, no...\\nThat’s the same as being robbed.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00011":"For Pokémon, happiness is being\\nwith a person who treats them well.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00012":"Huh?\\nIt’s holding an item.\\fYou should keep that.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00013":"Huh?\\nIts Poké Ball has a Ball Capsule on it!\\fPlease remove it.","msg_0576_T24R0201_00014":"Huh?\\nYou...only have one Pokémon!\\fYou can’t give it back to me then."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T24R0201_000":0,"obj_T24R0201_gsman2":0}}
